<article id="post-9142" class="post-9142 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-canadian-securities-exchange-magazine tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-csergc tag-mining tag-relevant-gold tag-rob-bergmann">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/relevant-gold-mapping-out-a-new-district-with-concepts-2-65-billion-years-in-the-making/" aria-hidden="true">
